  <h1>Night Run – a browser trading game</h1>
  <p><span class="age">18+</span> A free, satirical trading game set in Polish cities. No install, no sign-up, works on phone and desktop. Your progress is saved automatically.</p>
  <h2>How to play</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>You have 30 days, 2,000 zł and a debt to Uncle Zbych that grows 7% a day.</li>
    <li>Buy where it's cheap, sell where they pay more. The "cheap" and "pricey" labels help you decide.</li>
    <li>Travel between Warsaw, Kraków, Gdańsk, Wrocław, Poznań, Łódź, Katowice and Szczecin.</li>
    <li>Watch out for police and robberies. Upgrade to a bigger backpack, a scooter or a car, and get a prescription at the clinic.</li>
    <li>Your score is cash + bank − debt. The best runs make the leaderboard.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>About</h2>
  <p>Night Run is fiction and satire. It doesn't encourage breaking the law; it shows the risks and the consequences. The code is open source (MIT) – <a href="https://github.com/jbutton/nocny-kurs">github.com/jbutton/nocny-kurs</a>.</p>
  <h2>Privacy</h2>
  <p>The game uses no cookies and no tracking. Your save, language, nickname and leaderboard are stored only in your browser (localStorage) and are never sent anywhere. You can remove them by clearing this site's data in your browser.</p>
  <p><a href="../" hreflang="pl" lang="pl">Wersja polska: Nocny Kurs</a></p>
</Layout>
